Increases all unarmed damage by [29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66% (TL1-5)] and physical power by 30 (including grapples and kicks).

Note that brawlers naturally gain 0.5 Physical Power per character level while unarmed (current brawler physical power bonus: [0.5, 5.0, 13, 20, 25 (LVL 1-50)]) and attack 20% faster while unarmed.
